{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":487410,"name":"Lit Sky","username":"Lit_Sky","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/l/fbc32d/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-09-09T13:30:35.727Z","cooked":"\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-487410-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-487410-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eWhere does the bug appear (feature/product)?\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-487410-describe-the-bug-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-487410-describe-the-bug-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDescribe the Bug\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot desktop stays signed in in the UI, but every message fails with:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAuthentication error\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIf you are logged in, try logging out and back in.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eRe-login does not clear it. The bot (probot) never replies. Older threads from 22 Aug 2026 still show in the sidebar.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-487410-steps-to-reproduce-3\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-487410-steps-to-reproduce-3\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eSteps to Reproduce\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOpen Grok Bot on macOS and send any message (e.g. hi or open \u003ca href=\"http://www.xanda.cn\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003ewww.xanda.cn\u003c/a\u003e).\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSee the red banner: Authentication error / If you are logged in, try logging out and back in.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eClick the account at the bottom left of the sidebar → Sign out → confirm.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSign back in with the same Cursor account.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFully quit Grok Bot from the Dock (Quit), reopen, and sign in again.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSend another message.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-487410-expected-behavior-4\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-487410-expected-behavior-4\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eExpected Behavior\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAfter sign-out and sign-in (and a full quit/reopen), the session should be valid and the bot should reply.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-487410-screenshots-screen-recordings-5\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-487410-screenshots-screen-recordings-5\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eScreenshots / Screen Recordings\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/c/9/c91a3dcc17e0814c7f4fc2fdcdd88ffd87d9bc1c.png\" data-download-href=\"/uploads/short-url/sH2bZMgnAwOHyqhjZyh3GzHyTBa.png?dl=1\" title=\"ScreenShot_2026-09-09_212834_450.png\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/c/9/c91a3dcc17e0814c7f4fc2fdcdd88ffd87d9bc1c_2_690x494.png\" alt=\"ScreenShot_2026-09-09_212834_450.png\" data-base62-sha1=\"sH2bZMgnAwOHyqhjZyh3GzHyTBa\" width=\"690\" height=\"494\" srcset=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/c/9/c91a3dcc17e0814c7f4fc2fdcdd88ffd87d9bc1c_2_690x494.png, https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/c/9/c91a3dcc17e0814c7f4fc2fdcdd88ffd87d9bc1c_2_1035x741.png 1.5x, https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/c/9/c91a3dcc17e0814c7f4fc2fdcdd88ffd87d9bc1c_2_1380x988.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"0F0E0E\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"meta\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#far-image\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003cspan class=\"filename\"\u003eScreenShot_2026-09-09_212834_450.png\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"informations\"\u003e1426×1022 34.1 KB\u003c/span\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse hr